        {
          "text": "Caduff startete am Freitagabend (~22 Uhr) einen Read-only-Sweep über VPN auf die Checkpoints, in der einzigen Nacht ohne Audit-Logging.",
          "quote": "Yes. I ran an evaluation sweep from home, over the VPN, reading the checkpoints and computing the numbers for the paper. I started it around ten in the evening",
          "basis": "ungeprueft",
          "relation": {"type": "belastet", "from": "unit:IV03-L27", "to": "person:andrin.caduff"}
        },
        {
          "text": "Caduff war sich bewusst, dass das Audit-Logging in dieser Nacht abgeschaltet war.",
          "quote": "Everyone knew. It was in the channel. [pause] I did not think about it. I understand now that I should have thought about it.",
          "basis": "ungeprueft",
          "relation": {"type": "belastet", "from": "unit:IV03-L29", "to": "person:andrin.caduff"}
        }
      ]
    },
